    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Sleeping Arrangements<br>Two Story Home<br>1st Floor | Master Bedroom, King; Living Area, Queen Sleeper Sofa<br>2nd Floor | Master 2, King; Guest Bedroom, King; Guest Bedroom, King<br><br>Parking: This property provides two driveway parking spots, offering guests direct access to the unit.<br><br>Discover the ultimate coastal retreat at \"Mermaid Manor,\" a stunning Mediterranean-style villa nestled in the heart of SANDESTIN GOLF AND BEACH RESORT®, just steps from the vibrant Village of Baytowne Wharf. This two-story home offers one of the largest floor plans in the Villa Lago community, complete with ample driveway space and two brand-new 6-seat golf carts.<br><br>From the moment you cross the threshold into the grand foyer, you’ll feel the serenity of coastal living embrace you. The professionally designed interior, with its artful blend of upscale elegance and comfort, invites you to relax and unwind. The spacious living area is ideal for slow mornings and lingering evenings. French doors open onto an expansive screened patio, where lake and golf course views create the perfect backdrop for al fresco dining and morning coffee.<br><br>The well-appointed and fully-stocked chef’s kitchen is a culinary delight, boasting custom cabinetry, and marble countertops. An in-house coffee bar and wine cabinet ensure you’re always ready for any occasion. Whether dining at the stylish breakfast bar or the grand 10-person dining table, you'll enjoy beautiful views of the lush greens and sparkling lake.<br><br>The home’s bedrooms offer restful retreats, with a master suite on each floor. The first-floor master features a king bed and an en-suite bathroom with a luxurious oversized walk-in shower. Upstairs, the second master suite includes a private balcony, perfect for soaking in the coastal air, along with its own en-suite bath. Two additional guest rooms, each with king beds and en-suite bathrooms, ensure your guests enjoy their own slice of paradise.<br><br>Equipped with five new Smart TVs, brand-new furniture, plush king-size mattresses, and a sleeper sofa in the living area, this home caters to every modern need. The garage is stocked with full beach gear, and with two golf carts at your disposal, exploring the charming resort surroundings has never been easier.<br><br>Guest Walk-Through<br>First Floor– Kitchen, Living, Dining, 1 Master Bedroom, 1 Bathroom, Oversized Screened Back Patio<br>Second Floor- 2nd Master Bedroom, 2 Guest Bedrooms, 3 Bathrooms, Balcony, Laundry<br><br>Unit Amenities- 2 Golf Carts, BBQ Grill, Laundry, Driveway Parking for 2 Cars<br>Community Amenities- Community Pool<br>Resort Amenities- Gated Community, Multiple Pools, Resort Tram, Fitness Center/Spa/Salon, Golf, Tennis, Marina, Shops, Restaurants, Entertainment, Private Beach, Watersports<br><br>About the Community of Villa Lago<br>Villa Lago is the latest addition to the Resort offering single family 3-, 4- and 5-bedroom homes with Mediterranean-style and resort comforts. Enjoy amenities such as the community pool and the first class dining and entertainment options of the Village of Baytowne Wharf. Most properties have either a lake or golf course view. Rent with us today and discover what a truly relaxing and carefree vacation feels like at Villa Lago. Amenities such as golf, tennis, biking, boating, water sports & more are available locally at additional costs.<br><br>Local Favorites<br>MVH guests receive savings with our Local Favorites. Enjoy discounts to restaurants, beach activities, and shopping so you can save while you stay.<br><br>MVH Beach Closet<br>This property offers a Beach Closet stocked with complimentary beach chairs and an umbrella for use during your stay.<br><br>MVH Rental Restrictions<br>Please reference the Rental Restrictions and Terms of Use.<br><br>SANDESTIN® is a federally registered trademark owned by Sandestin Investments, LLC (“SI”). My Vacation Haven, LLC is an independent entity and is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or associated with SI. Any use or reference to SI or its trademarks is solely to identify a property and not to suggest any affiliation with SI.",
